@startuml
title From a creation prompt to a verified change

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor<<dev>> #FFF8E1
  BackgroundColor<<author>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<pipeline>> #F4F7F9
  BackgroundColor<<expert>> #C8E6C9
}

start
:**Developer**\nTakes the next creation prompt of the backlog; <<dev>>
repeat
  :**Author agent**\nReads the specification the prompt names\nWrites the named tests, then the code\nRuns the whole build\nOpens or updates the pull request, and reports; <<author>>
  :**Pipeline**\nRuns the gates of document 06-05\nDeterministic: they block; <<pipeline>>
  :**Expert agents**\nCompare the change with the specification\nAdvisers: they comment; <<expert>>
  :**Developer**\nReads the change, the gates and the findings; <<dev>>
repeat while (Gates pass, and every finding is\nfixed or dismissed with a reason?) is (no) not (yes)
:**Developer**\nMerges; <<dev>>
:**Pipeline**\nDelivers to the environments; <<pipeline>>
:**Expert agents**\nThe environment verifier compares\nwhat runs with the specification; <<expert>>
stop
@enduml
